-- Created the Story 2.3 implementation-ready artifact with concrete tasks tied to the current live dashboard architecture.
-- Included explicit guidance for disruption classification, disruption scope, header and mode-card emphasis, and calm public-copy rules.
-- Incorporated continuity from Stories 2.1 and 2.2 so the dev agent extends the existing live path instead of building a parallel alert model.
-- Captured official-source technical sanity checks on 2026-03-19 and confirmed no stack change is required for this story.
-- Updated sprint tracking so Story 2.3 is now marked `ready-for-dev`.
+- Implemented first-class disruption emphasis in the canonical snapshot, live snapshot builder, fixture snapshot, and presenter so overall and local disruption remain distinguishable without ad hoc component logic.
