codex
**Findings**
1. High: unavailable nearby modes were inheriting fixture service-state cues, so a provider failure with no stored data could still imply observed caution states. Fixed in [build-dashboard-snapshot.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/dashboard/build-dashboard-snapshot.js#L21) and [build-dashboard-snapshot.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/dashboard/build-dashboard-snapshot.js#L175).
2. High: full fallback was still presenting the fixture’s `watchful` picture during total provider failure, overstating certainty. Fixed in [dashboard-service.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/dashboard/dashboard-service.js#L71).
3. Medium: mode cards still showed `Open`/`Watch` even when the canonical source status was `carried-forward` or `unavailable`. Fixed in [ModeSummaryCard.tsx](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/dashboard/components/ModeSummaryCard.tsx#L25).
4. Medium: the story artifact claimed a changed file that was not actually part of the diff. Reconciled in [2-4-preserve-honest-usefulness-during-provider-failure.md](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/2-4-preserve-honest-usefulness-during-provider-failure.md#L317).

All four were auto-fixed. I also added regression coverage for the unavailable mixed-snapshot path and the whole-route fallback honesty path in [dashboard.live-path.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/dashboard.live-path.test.mjs#L195), updated the story review record in [2-4-preserve-honest-usefulness-during-provider-failure.md](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/2-4-preserve-honest-usefulness-during-provider-failure.md#L343), and moved sprint tracking to done in [sprint-status.yaml](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/sprint-status.yaml).

Verification passed: `npm run test:unit -- tests/unit/dashboard.live-path.test.mjs tests/unit/dashboard.presenter.test.mjs tests/unit/dashboard.trust.test.mjs` and `npm run validate`.

No open high or medium findings remain.
