Implemented Story 3.1 end to end and moved it to `review` in the sprint artifacts.

The `(ops)` route is now a real local-only surface in [src/app/(ops)/ops/page.tsx](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/app/(ops)/ops/page.tsx). Access is enforced server-side through [src/lib/server/security/assert-ops-access.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/security/assert-ops-access.js), which denies by default and only allows loopback plus hosts from `OPS_ALLOWED_HOSTS`. Denied requests fall through `notFound()` without leaking ops/admin details. The first maintenance shell lives in [src/features/ops/components/OpsShell.tsx](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/components/OpsShell.tsx) with its plain-language content model in [src/features/ops/ops-shell-content.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/ops-shell-content.js), and the keyboard/focus styling was added in [src/app/globals.css](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/app/globals.css). Public-route files were left free of ops behavior.

Coverage was updated in [tests/smoke/startup-smoke.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/smoke/startup-smoke.test.mjs), [tests/unit/ops-access.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/ops-access.test.mjs), and [tests/unit/ops-shell.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/ops-shell.test.mjs). Story tracking was updated in [docs/sprint-artifacts/3-1-provide-a-separate-local-only-ops-access-surface.md](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/3-1-provide-a-separate-local-only-ops-access-surface.md) and [docs/sprint-artifacts/sprint-status.yaml](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/sprint-status.yaml).

